| **T2: Certified** | Medium-risk (customer support, education) | Human fallback, bias testing, ISO 42001 alignment | EU-MENA trade corridors |
| **T3: High-Assurance** | High-risk (medical pre-screening, legal) | Formal verification, continuous monitoring, liability insurance | Regulated EU sectors |

### 4.6.4 Mapping Protocol
